He went to Palestine.

c0232
00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:10.780
You know he went to Palestine.

c0233
00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:12.940
Oh, yes.

c0234
00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:13.940
I know.

c0235
00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:14.619
I know.

c0236
00:13:14.619 --> 00:13:15.179
I know.

c0237
