c0996
00:57:46.780 --> 00:57:49.620
Isn't it shocking, Anders?

c0997
00:57:49.620 --> 00:57:55.659
Now, that was at one level, all right?

c0998
00:57:55.659 --> 00:57:57.939
The question was, he says,

c0999
00:57:57.939 --> 00:58:03.459
