c1002
00:58:09.540 --> 00:58:14.620
Or like the secularists, let's go with the other.

c1003
00:58:14.620 --> 00:58:16.820
But we have to make an intelligent choice

c1004
00:58:16.820 --> 00:58:20.459
which kind of goyim and in what situation

c1005
00:58:20.459 --> 00:58:24.100
we want to ally ourselves with them.

c1006
00:58:24.100 --> 00:58:27.139
One of the most important effects of Rabbi Seymour Shahazan

c1007
00:58:27.139 --> 00:58:30.659
was that we should not participate

c1008
00:58:30.659 --> 00:58:33.540
