c1009
00:58:33.540 --> 00:58:39.139
Countries like in Italy, Greece, and others,

c1010
00:58:39.139 --> 00:58:43.340
they were revolting against the former governments.

c1011
00:58:43.340 --> 00:58:48.300
His point was, Jew should not revolt against a government.

c1012
00:58:48.300 --> 00:58:50.739
Why?

c1013
00:58:50.739 --> 00:58:53.340
Because our government is not that government.

c1014
00:58:53.340 --> 00:58:55.659
Our government is Israel.

c1015
00:58:55.659 --> 00:58:59.340
And now, the Sephardim, because of Rabbi Seymour Shahazan,

c1016
00:58:59.340 --> 00:59:02.459
