The last name is Aguilar.

c1044
01:00:25.419 --> 01:00:29.580
And the first name is Grace, a woman.

c1045
01:00:29.580 --> 01:00:35.379
Grace Aguilar, born 1816, died 1847.

c1046
01:00:35.379 --> 01:00:38.260
She says like this.

c1047
01:00:38.260 --> 01:00:43.540
It says, the preservation of our law in its original purity

c1048
01:00:43.540 --> 01:00:46.780
was a supreme duty in ancient times.

c1049
01:00:46.780 --> 01:00:51.300
How much more requisite must it be now in modern times?

c1050
01:00:51.300 --> 01:00:54.860
Hebrew was the silver link that would

c1051
01:00:54.860 --> 01:00:59.260
give unity to the Jewish nations scattered throughout the earth.

c1052
01:00:59.260 --> 01:01:00.820
Yes?

c1053
01:01:00.820 --> 01:01:05.860
We proceed, here we proceed to the reminder of this verse.

c1054
01:01:05.860 --> 01:01:08.500
Maybe we permitted to hint on the importance

c1055
01:01:08.500 --> 01:01:15.340
