c1056
01:01:15.340 --> 01:01:19.219
Against those who argue that Hebrew is a dead language,

c1057
01:01:19.219 --> 01:01:23.219
Grace Aguilar, a woman, Sepharadi woman,

c1058
01:01:23.219 --> 01:01:26.739
she said, it cannot be considered a dead language

c1059
01:01:26.739 --> 01:01:30.100
for the nation to which it originally belonged

c1060
01:01:30.100 --> 01:01:34.020
continued to exist and will exist forever.

c1061
01:01:34.020 --> 01:01:38.659
Now, she believed, she had heard she

c1062
01:01:38.659 --> 01:01:43.340
was one of the famous followers of Seymour Shahazan,

c1063
01:01:43.340 --> 01:01:47.699
that unity among the Jews will come not when we speak

c1064
01:01:47.699 --> 01:01:50.179
Ladino or Arabic or Yiddish, but we

c1065
01:01:50.179 --> 01:01:53.300
have one single language that's going to unite

c1066
01:01:53.300 --> 01:01:55.540
all the Jews from all over.

c1067
01:01:55.540 --> 01:02:00.100
It says, it is not indeed spoken today Hebrew

c1068
01:02:00.100 --> 01:02:04.260
as it would have been had we remained in our land.

c1069
01:02:04.260 --> 01:02:07.179
Yet it might still continue to link

c1070
01:02:07.179 --> 01:02:11.659
