c1076
01:02:24.580 --> 01:02:27.699
Means our home language is Hebrew

c1077
01:02:27.699 --> 01:02:32.699
and that should become the language of every single Jew.

c1078
01:02:32.699 --> 01:02:35.540
She published this 1842.

c1079
01:02:35.540 --> 01:02:38.780
She published this 1842.

c1080
01:02:38.780 --> 01:02:42.699
The whole Zionist movement came 100 years later,

c1081
