c1095
01:03:20.580 --> 01:03:23.979
The child simply cannot, the mind cannot understand.

c1096
01:03:23.979 --> 01:03:27.100
The first task in the Talmud Tora

c1097
01:03:27.100 --> 01:03:30.780
