c1098
01:03:30.780 --> 01:03:32.659
Beautiful ideas, yes?

c1099
01:03:32.659 --> 01:03:38.179
So now, they begin thinking at the political term.

c1100
01:03:38.179 --> 01:03:40.899
Hebrew should become the language

c1101
01:03:40.899 --> 01:03:46.659
that is going to foster unity among all the Jews in the world.

c1102
01:03:46.659 --> 01:03:57.659
Second, another girl, Abigail Abarbanel Lindo, died 1848.

