They start producing books, so that you have like a bullet.

c1107
01:04:09.699 --> 01:04:12.540
You know, I saw that I have the book, the rare book.

c1108
01:04:12.540 --> 01:04:14.500
It's just to teach you phrases and so on,

c1109
01:04:14.500 --> 01:04:16.260
