c1180
01:08:07.139 --> 01:08:08.780
And about what happened.

c1181
01:08:08.780 --> 01:08:13.060
And he tells about Rabbi Avivas.

c1182
01:08:13.060 --> 01:08:16.740
And he says, a fantastic says, says like this,

c1183
01:08:16.740 --> 01:08:19.979
that the people in Corfu, yes?

